<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary">cloud_download</span>
<span>Xuất Báo Cáo Đối Soát (.xlsx)</span>
</a>
<a class="px-space-md py-space-sm bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md rounded flex items-center gap-space-xs hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors border border-outline-variant/40" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add_box</span>
<span>Tạo Yêu Cầu Đặt Mới</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Main Content Body -->
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-gutter py-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
