<span class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-error">01</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error font-semibold bg-error-container/60 px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded">Cần xử lý ngay</span>
</div>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Lô #LTB-ORD-2025-084 lệch ca xe</span>
