<span class="bg-surface-dim text-on-surface px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px]">2</span>
</button>
<button class="px-space-md py-space-sm rounded font-label-md text-label-md bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-space-xs whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
<span>Đang được nhân viên xem xét (Under Review)</span>
<span class="bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold">3</span>
</button>
<button class="px-space-md py-space-sm rounded font-label-md text-label-md bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-space-xs whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">
